    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 10/11/2025, the use of the ground floor front, ground floor rear studio and first floor flat at the property at 29 Ivanhoe Road, Hounslow, TW4 7JH, as three self contained flats was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act for the following reason:\r\nThe applicant has provided sufficient information to evidence that, on the balance of probabilities, the property has been in use as three self-contained flats for a continuous period of at least four years. \r\n"
